-- Details for the slips we already have, worked out from each slip's notes and, for opening
-- hours, a look at each venue's listing in Nov 2026. Hours we couldn't confirm stay empty (the jar
-- treats those as open and the card says to check). Matched by title, and only fills what's empty,
-- so anything we've edited in the app stays as it is.

